<newsitem itemid="411897" id="root" date="1997-02-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: ICTSI sets $63 million convertible bonds.</title>
<headline>ICTSI sets $63 million convertible bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Robert Fleming.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL CONTAINER TERMINAL SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    $63 MLN*	COUPON     1.75	MATURITY ***13.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.MAR.98</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE**     SALE LIMITS UK/PH/US</p>
<p>NOTES</p>
<p>*$8 MLN MANAGERS' OPTION</p>
<p>CONVERSION PRICE 17.875 FILIPINO PESOS, A 10 PERCENT PREMIUM</p>
<p>OVER THE 27.FEB. CLOSING SHARE PRICE OF 16.25 FILIPINO PESOS</p>
<p>FIXED EXCHANGE RATE 27.582 FILIPINO PESOS PER $1</p>
<p>**GIVING 1,473 SHARES PER BOND</p>
<p>***PUT OPTION ON 13.MAR.02 AT 135.75 TO YIELD APPROX 7.86 PCT</p>
<p>ANNUALLY, HARD NON-CALL FOR THREE YEARS, CALLABLE FOR NEXT TWO</p>
<p>YEARS AT ACCRETED VALUE, THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT PAR SUBJECT TO</p>
<p>140 PCT TRIGGER</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
